    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "80e73b06bd5dfc18",
      "line_num": 121,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#feature",
        "#kanban"
      ],
      "text": "**Inline TODO completion tracking: Snapshot-and-diff approach to detect when inline TODOs are removed between scans and show them as completed in the Done column. Uses `.todoscope-snapshot.json` and `.todoscope-done.json`. Git-history-independent \u2014 works on shallow clones.**\n`#feature` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L121`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 60
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "89cc685d1e69ef29",
      "line_num": 122,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#feature",
        "#editor",
        "#kanban"
      ],
      "text": "**TODO editor + checkbox write-back: Interactive checkboxes on kanban cards that write back to TODO.md. Includes atomic mutations, optimistic concurrency, advisory file locking, add-TODO form, and merge conflict detection.**\n`#feature` `#editor` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L122`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 150
    },
